Package: lazymatrix
Title: Perform Complex Matrix Operations Symbolically on Sparse Matrices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Viktor", "Segersall", , "viktor.segersall@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a framework for symbolic computation on high-order sparse matrices.
    Enables lazy evaluation of normalized data matrices.
    Preserves sparsity throughout chained operations without materializing dense intermediate objects.
